  "details": "- Upgrade to openjdk-11.0.32+9 (GA). The following CVEs were fixed:\n- CVE-2026-47063: enhance jar handling\n- CVE-2026-46917: improve DTLS handshaking\n- CVE-2026-47027: enhance jar file processing\n- CVE-2026-47021: enhance XBM image support\n- CVE-2026-60147: improve certification checking\n- CVE-2026-46968: enhance TLS certificate handling\n- CVE-2026-47010: enhance JPEG handling\n- CVE-2026-47059: enhance AWT ImagingLib\n- CVE-2026-47057: improve Nashorn index handling\n- CVE-2026-47058: enhance DataView implementation\n- Rebase FIPS patch from the rh-openjdk fips branch (06df8f9bd4) for 11.0.32",
